*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*  UNDERGROUND STRUCTURE - PLATE ELEMENT MODEL - WITH LOADS
*  11 PRIMARY LOAD CASES + 5 COMBINATIONS.  SECTIONS CHECKED BY HAND (Master Part B).
*
*  UNITS      : METRE / kN
*  AXES       : X = length 22.000   Z = width 6.200   Y = VERTICAL
*  MODELLING  : MID-SURFACE.  Y = 0.000 is the UNDERSIDE OF THE MAT
*               (site level -6.700).  Level mapping:
*                 Y 0.300 = mat mid-surface        (site -6.400)
*                 Y 0.600 = internal floor         (site -6.100)
*                 Y 3.800 = roof soffit            (site -2.900)
*                 Y 4.250 = roof mid-surface       (site -2.450)
*                 Y 4.700 = top of roof slab       (site -2.000)
*  WALL C/L   : X 0.300 / 21.700 ; Z 0.300 / 5.900 (600 thick perimeter)
*  INT WALLS  : W5 c/l X 12.700 (200 thk)
*               W6 c/l X 15.000 and W7 c/l X 18.200 (400 thk - MOD M1)
*  ROOF VOIDS : stair shaft X 15.000-18.200 (wall c/l to wall c/l);
*               escape shafts 1.400 sq at (2.050, 2.050) and (19.900, 2.050)
*  NUMBERING   : n = (k-1)*310 + (i-1)*10 + j   i = X index 1..31,
*                j = Z index 1..10, k = Y level 1..7.
*                Systematic - reproducible by hand from the grid lists.
*  REV E       : stair opening reduced to Z 0.300-4.010 so the pressure slab
*                forms the HEADHOUSE FLOOR over the far end of the shaft.
*                Roof 226 -> 238 plates; wall plate numbers shift by +12.
*  MOD M1      : APPROVED.  W6 and W7 200 -> 400 thk; box 21.600 -> 22.000;
*                shaft 15.200-18.000; ESC 2 X 19.500 -> 19.900; headhouse and
*                covered stairwell +200.  Blast on W6/W7 added as LOAD 11.
*                Master Part A.3 / A.4 / B.2, Finding F1.
*  REV C       : box lengthened 20.200 -> 21.600 and both escape openings
*               re-set to give 750 mm min clear to every structural wall
*               face.  Previously 50 mm - not buildable.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*
