509 TO 976 THICKNESS 0.6
977 TO 1030 THICKNESS 0.2
1031 TO 1138 THICKNESS 0.4
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL M35 ALL
*
* =====================================================================
*  SUPPORTS - ELASTIC FOUNDATION ON DECCAN BASALT
*  ELASTIC MAT: STAAD works out each joint's tributary area from the mat
*  plates and forms a vertical spring KFY = ks x A_trib.
*  ks = 100000 kN/m3 [ASSUMED - Deccan basalt, pending site investigation].
*  RE-RUN AT ks = 500000 to bracket the mat moments; they are sensitive to it.
*
*  Hand check on the spring values STAAD should produce:
*    typical interior joint, A_trib ~0.441 m2 -> KFY ~44,100 kN/m
*    largest joint,          A_trib ~0.578 m2 -> KFY ~57,750 kN/m
*    corner joint,           A_trib ~0.069 m2 -> KFY ~6,891 kN/m
*    sum of all tributary areas = 119.84 m2  (must equal the mat area 119.84)
*
*  ELASTIC MAT gives VERTICAL springs only, so four widely separated mat
*  joints are additionally held in X and Z to stop rigid-body drift.
*  A joint takes ONE support specification, so the FIXED BUT line REPLACES
*  the ELASTIC MAT entry at those four joints.  KFY is therefore restated
*  explicitly on them - without it the mat corners would have NO vertical
*  restraint at all.
* =====================================================================
SUPPORTS
1 TO 310 ELASTIC MAT DIRECT Y SUBGRADE 100000
* KFY restated on the four corner joints: without it they would lose ALL vertical
* restraint, because the FIXED BUT line replaces their ELASTIC MAT entry.
* KFY = ks x A_trib, A_trib from the post-M1 mesh:
1 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 6891
10 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 8269
301 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 7219
310 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 8663
*
* =====================================================================
*  LOADING - WORKED EXAMPLE.  Every pressure is in kN/m2, global axes.
*  PRESSURE GX / GY / GZ acts along the GLOBAL axis, so it does not
*  depend on the plate local-axis direction.  Use it in preference to
*  plain PRESSURE, which follows local z.
* =====================================================================
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL1 SELF WEIGHT
SELFWEIGHT Y -1 
LOAD 2 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL2 EARTH COVER ON ROOF 40.65 KN/M2
ELEMENT LOAD
271 TO 508 PR GY -40.65
LOAD 3 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL3 SIDL SERVICES AND FINISHES
ELEMENT LOAD
271 TO 508 PR GY -2
1 TO 270 PR GY -1
LOAD 4 LOADTYPE Live  TITLE LL1 LIVE LOAD ON INTERNAL FLOOR 5.0 KN/M2
ELEMENT LOAD
1 TO 270 PR GY -5
LOAD 5 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL4 STAIRCASE ON THE TWO SHAFT WALLS
ELEMENT LOAD
1031 TO 1084 PR GY -2.947
1085 TO 1138 PR GY -2.947
LOAD 6 LOADTYPE Soil  TITLE EP1 EARTH + WATER ON EXTERNAL WALLS
ELEMENT LOAD
